WEBVTT

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:05.630
Banagher is brought aboard
the Londo Bell flagship Ra Cailum

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:08.760
by the black Unicorn Gundam, the Banshee.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.340
Here, he is reunited with Marida Cruz,

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.930
who has been reconditioned by
Martha Vist Carbine of the Vist Foundation.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:21.090
As Banagher blames himself
for his inability to save Marida and Loni,

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:26.050
Captain Bright Noa of the Ra Cailum
approaches him with an operation proposal.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.470
Audrey's there?!

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:31.220
The Sleeves' Garencieres will carry out a
rescue operation

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.840
during the Garuda transfer.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.340
Join the fight on their side.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:38.180
Bright now considers Banagher
in the same league

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.130
as the legendary Gundam pilots.

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:41.680
Audrey...

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:43.970
I'm coming!

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:19.840
(CLASH OF THE TWO UNICORNS)

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:37.550
All of your weapons
have been disengaged.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.630
I suggest you don't resist.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.180
Ms. Marida!

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:45.130
I am Ple Twelve.
My name is not Marida.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:49.090
What are you talking about?
What are you doing in that mobile suit?

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:50.760
The Captain and the rest of
the crew are worried about- -

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:53.180
Don't... talk to me as if we're friends.

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:54.220
It's me!

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:59.340
It's Banagher Links! I came to Earth
with the Captain- - with your Master!

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:01.840
Ple Twelve!
Pay no attention to him!

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:04.630
Understood, Master.

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.300
Is everything all right?

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:07.630
The suit is operating perfectly.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:12.220
I was talking about you. If anything
is wrong, however trivial, report it.

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:13.180
Yes.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.930
If you're in pain,
don't try to tough it out.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:16.880
If something is bothering you,
feel free to tell me.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.340
- Is that an order?
- And when- -

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:23.840
Ms. Marida...

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:31.970
Is that them?

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.930
It's the Garencieres! The Garuda's
defense forces are engaging them!

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.680
Opening combat bridge!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.760
Not yet. Have the suits of Nigel's team
ascertain the situation.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:16.680
Our mission is to deliver
the Unicorn to the Garuda.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:19.300
So there's no need for us to
get involved in the battle.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:32.510
It's started, huh?

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:34.840
These Zeon bastards just don't quit!

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:38.550
All suits, maintain formation!
Don't take your eyes off the Unicorn!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:40.970
Don't interfere!

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.300
Move the ship in closer!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.470
Are you really going through with this?!

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.930
If I can get aboard,
she's as good as ours!

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:55.680
Come on, act your age!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.720
What's this feeling?

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.470
I can't let the Captain and
Ms. Marida fight each other!

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.010
Watts!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.050
What the- -?

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.130
Watts!

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:23.840
Ms. Marida, you have to listen to me!

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:26.970
The Captain is here. The crew of the
Garencieres is coming to rescue Audrey!

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:39.220
He's refusing to kill, huh?

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:05.220
He's planning on boarding it in midair?

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:19.090
Ple Twelve!

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:21.930
Shoot down the Base Jabber
that's latched onto the Garuda!

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:23.680
That's the enemy!

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:24.880
Roger that.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:28.880
Don't do it, Ms. Marida!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:33.840
There he goes again!

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:35.680
What happened to our escorts
from the Ra Cailum?!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:39.470
All craft are descending and disengaging to
assist damaged or crashed consort craft!

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:41.130
Hold still! I'm not gonna
follow you down into the sea!

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:45.300
So that's what's going on!
They're all working together!

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.800
I won't let you!

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.590
Banagher...

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:59.050
Highness, the shuttle launch
has been moved up.

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:00.470
Please come with me.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:18.050
My Master said that I should
secure the pilot and cockpit!

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:19.550
Please, snap out of it!

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:21.840
Your Master would never...
The Captain never ask you to do this!

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:26.970
You and the Captain should never,
ever fight each other!

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:36.380
I'm Ple Twelve.
My Master is Alberto Vist!

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:38.930
No you're not!
You're Ms. Marida.

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:42.220
Your captain is Lt. Zinnerman
of the Garencieres!

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:47.470
Ple Twelve!

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:50.050
Calm yourself and
listen to only my words!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:53.510
Everything else are the words of the
enemy and are meant to confuse you!

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.680
Please remember! You and the Captain were
so trusting and supporting of each other!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:01.840
You don't need to listen to anything
he says! The Gundam is your enemy!

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:03.380
Capture it at once and bring it- -

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.130
Shut up!

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:09.590
Ple Twelve!

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:11.220
Can't you close that hatch?

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:29.300
I came to get you.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:36.800
What's that?

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.210
Ms. Marida!

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:57.420
The Gundam is... the enemy!

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:01.590
No, Unicorn! Don't!

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:05.630
Don't let it suck you in!
Fight it!

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.300
Hurry, get aboard the Delta Plus!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:22.800
Ensign Riddhe.
Do you understand your position?

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:24.920
It's because I understand
that I'm doing this.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:27.880
And do you have any idea
what would happen

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:29.960
if you killed the son of
Ronan Marcenas?

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:32.760
You can have Banagher and the Unicorn.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:34.670
But you're going to return her to me.

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.380
What are you doing?
Hurry.

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:39.840
What do you intend to do
after you take me away with you?

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:41.840
We can worry about that
after we get out of here.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:47.170
What is it that you want to protect?
Me, as a human being?

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.800
The secret of Laplace's Box?
Or is it your family's hon- -

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:51.760
I don't give a damn about my family!

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:56.460
Ever since Laplace was blown up
a hundred years ago,

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:58.340
everything started to go wrong.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:02.340
Me, my father... Even the people here.

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:05.340
We've all been the playthings
of its twisted consequences.

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.920
But regardless of how twisted
this world is,

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:10.380
ten billion people still live in it,

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.090
...so nothing can be done about it.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.210
All we can do is protect it!

00:11:14.260 --> 00:11:18.260
I can't let everything to be turned
upside down like it was by the Zeons.

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:22.210
Exactly! We must protect
the secret of the Box!

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:25.590
Princess Mineva understands this, as well.
That is precisely why you should- -

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:30.170
Shut up! Your founder is the one
who's responsible for all this!

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:32.840
It was just dumb luck

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:36.630
that the Box fell into
the hands of your founder, Syam Vist.

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:39.210
His plan to use the assassination
of the first prime minister

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.340
and the hard-line policies

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:43.630
that resulted from it to become
powerful was working perfectly.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:46.840
But then Zeon called for
Spacenoid independence,

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:49.840
the One Year War broke out,
and everything changed.

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:54.300
When that happened, both Syam Vist,
who came up with the conspiracy,

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:56.920
and the Federation Government,
which implemented it, finally realized it.

00:11:56.960 --> 00:12:02.380
The significance of what they had done.
The true power that Laplace's Box held.

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:05.380
You know what it is.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:10.420
Please, tell me. What is this Box
that is causing you such suffering?

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:13.960
Everyone standing here
has a right to know.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:22.760
Banagher!

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.510
Mineva!
Please, come with me!

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.420
The Unicorn is dangerous.

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.880
With the revelation that
Newtypes really exist,

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:38.260
the prayer of a hundred years ago
was turned into a curse.

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:39.630
So please...

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:40.880
Curse?

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.800
I don't have the power
to change the world.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:45.880
Even if it's an imperfect system,

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:48.800
if there's no way to change it,
I'll protect it.

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:51.670
That also means protecting you- -

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:54.800
- It's coming from above! Look out!
- It's an intruder! Ms. Martha!

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:56.130
Is it Neo Zeons?!

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:14.840
Mineva!

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:36.550
Ms. Marida! Please, stop!

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:38.050
Light...

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:42.010
This is the light that will save me.
I won't let anyone steal it from me!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.050
You're wrong!

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:45.510
That's not what this is.
This isn't normal.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.010
This light is dangerous!

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:50.710
What are you doing?!
Bring Mineva back here!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.550
It's not safe here!

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:57.590
The Unicorn and Banshee might be
resonating and generating a psycho-field!

00:13:57.630 --> 00:14:00.050
We're looking at another
Axis Shock, is that it?

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:03.920
And if that's the case,
not even this Garuda can...

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:13.420
The Garencieres is here.
Please jump out of the ship and use this.

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:14.420
What about you?

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:17.050
I'll catch up to you in no time.
Hurry, Highness!

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.920
If this keeps up, Audrey will be...!

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:40.960
It's under his complete control!

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:43.550
How can that boy pilot it like this?

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:44.960
That boy...

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:02.960
Don't move!
I'll be right there!

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:12.010
What are you doing?! Hurry!
Give me your hand!

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.840
Riddhe. We're following different paths.

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.380
This is hardly the time!

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:19.630
I'm a woman of the Zabi family.

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:22.670
I will see for myself
what Laplace's Box really is.

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:26.550
I had always believed that even a
twisted system is preferable to war.

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:30.630
But if the only purpose of that system
is to stifle humanity...

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:31.630
Mineva...

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:35.550
Then perhaps I will be guilty of crimes
as great as my father's and grandfather's.

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:37.010
But even so, I...

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:39.420
Are you planning to fight
the world alone?

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:42.880
No one believes that
the world will ever change.

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:46.840
No one cares about a world a century
from now that they won't live to see!

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:52.510
For the sake of people like that,

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:55.710
what's the point of going to such lengths
and making enemies of those people?

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.630
I'm not alone.

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.590
Mineva, don't!

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:03.590
Goodbye. I'll never forget you.

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:07.880
Mineva!

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:16.130
Catch me, Banagher...

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:18.710
Audrey!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.170
You can do this, right, Unicorn?

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:13.840
I'll get us through this.

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:53.880
They're still coming...

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:56.550
Flaste, I apologize for all the trouble.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.050
Not at all, ma'am...

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:02.800
Banagher, we're counting on you
to rescue the Captain and Marida.

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:03.840
Right.

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:05.170
Banagher.

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:08.510
I heard your voice, plain as day.
That made me so happy.

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.670
I felt like I finally understood
what it was

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:12.130
that I was doing here.

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:14.090
Because you called out to me.

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:15.960
So did I.

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:17.920
If what I'm feeling is the real thing,

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:20.960
I think my voice
should also get through to Ms. Marida.

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:23.590
I'll bring her back, no matter what.

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:26.130
Wait for me here. Okay?

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:29.010
Sure.

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:32.960
Then I shall leave you to it,
Banagher Links.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.760
Those despicable Gundams...!

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:17.050
You're a Gundam, too?!

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:38.050
Gundams are the enemy!
Enemies that must be defeated!

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:39.840
Stop it, Ms. Marida!

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:41.840
Please! Come to your senses!

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:51.050
That voice keeps echoing in my head!

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:54.760
The fact that your head is hurting
proves that the real you is resisting!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:01.130
If that's you, Marida, listen to me!
It's me! Zinnerman!

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.130
What...?!

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:04.340
Zinnerman... Master?

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:08.300
Those Foundation bastards
reconditioned you, didn't they?!

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:10.130
Marida, come back to me!

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:13.170
If you come home,
it'll all be like it used to be!

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:22.170
My Master...
My Master is...

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:26.460
This is my daughter.
Her name was Marie.

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:29.510
If she were still alive,
she'd be the same age as you.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:34.460
Open your hatch and come out, Marida!

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:38.170
Let's go back to space together!
Come with me!

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.840
Don't leave me alone!

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:58.630
Damned Gundams...

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:02.090
Gundam! Gundam!

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:05.920
Gundam! Gundam! Gunda...

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:11.130
I'm a Gundam...

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:13.380
I'm... the enemy!

00:21:55.300 --> 00:21:56.710
Marie...

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:41.510
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.550 --> 00:23:43.510
WAITING IN SPACE

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:48.420
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
